 discipline="ask who coordinates, whether workers must talk, and whether they touch the same files, before you name a tool.",
 counter="worktrees, cross-session messaging and /batch are not ways to run agents; they support the five approaches, and treating them as peers is how people pick the wrong one [Claude Code docs, Run agents in parallel, 2026].",
